  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Long-term support to the multi-donor General Education Quality Improvement for Equity Project in Ethiopia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The General Education Quality Improvement Project for Equity aims to assist the Government in Ethiopia to improve internal efficiency, equitable access, and quality in general education.</narrative>
  </description>
